  "solution": "Gọi <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>K</mi></semantics></math> là điểm giao của con đường cần làm với vạch chắn <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></semantics></math>. Đặt <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math> (m), với <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>25</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, khi đó\n\t\t<ul class=\"\"><li><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>N</mi><msup><mi>K</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>100</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>;</li><li><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>C</mi><msup><mi>M</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>M</mi><msup><mi>K</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>100</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>.</li></ul>\n\t\tThời gian làm con đường là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mrow><mn>100</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mn>15</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mrow><mn>100</mn><mo>+</mo><